{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09660","headline":"行军诗二首 二 · 岑参","name":"行军诗二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早知逢世乱，少小谩读书。\n悔不学弯弓，向东射狂胡。\n偶从谏官列，谬向丹墀趋。\n未能匡吾君，虚作一丈夫。\n抚劒伤世路，哀歌泣良图。\n功业今已迟，览镜悲白须。\n平生抱忠义，不敢私微躯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09660.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09660","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}